From db33ff3a1db28cb2d14d3a7988de716c4196aeef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bedirhan=20Gen=C3=A7aslan?=
 <b2210356065@cs.hacettepe.edu.tr>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 20:21:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 21/71] tui: give Suffice its own visual identity

Replace the boxed session header with a left accent rail, drop the
OpenAI-lettered ASCII animation for a Suffice-lettered one, and unify the
composer prompt and terminal-title spinner on the same block glyph so the
whole surface reads as one mark instead of Codex's chevron and braille dots.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
